# r1116 phase 1, boot 3 (same world p1tx, Devtools rebuilt 00:08 with the tickwarp count and watch t=0 fixes):
# reruns of tx.qb rows on a fresh world p1tx2 (the setup row rebuilds the chest, field and golem). Batch faults fixed: -01 verb list order; -05 sand falls 2 ticks after setblock, so blocktick
# goes in with pace 0; -08 the 40-tick watch ended before the bread went in (pace 0 now); -12 the weak attack needs
# pace 0 (2 s recharges fully) and the respawn hit also has strength=1; -14 group A is peaceful (food refills),
# difficulty easy for the row. -11 xp: 1.19.2 drops orbs inside die(), xp>0 is right (queue text wrong).
pace 2

## SQ-TX-00r | setup
> forceload add 896 880 1007 927
> time set noon
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> weather clear
> cdevtest place 900 -60 900 minecraft:chest[facing=north]
> item replace block 900 -60 900 container.0 with minecraft:apple 5
> fill 920 -61 902 935 -61 917 minecraft:farmland
> summon minecraft:iron_golem 961 -60 900 {NoAI:1b}
sleep 2

## SQ-TX-01r | help, unknown verb, unloaded pos, missing arg
> cdevtest help
> cdevtest bogus
> cdevtest state 0 -60 4000
> cdevtest count 1 2 3
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=help verbs=\S*\bstate,\S*\bstates,tickwarp,
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=bogus error="unknown verb
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=bogus done=0
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=state error="unloaded 0,-60,4000
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=count error="missing to x"
reject Exception|\tat 

## SQ-TX-05r | blocktick on sand, sent in the same tick as the setblock
pace 0
> setblock 905 -55 901 minecraft:sand
> cdevtest blocktick 905 -55 901
pace 2
sleep 3
> cdevtest items 905 -60 901 2
> cdevtest state 905 -60 901
expect verb=blocktick before=minecraft:sand after=minecraft:air
expect verb=state pos=905,-60,901 state=minecraft:sand

## SQ-TX-06r | tickwarp 2400
> time query gametime
capture G0 The time is (\d+)
> cdevtest tickwarp 2400
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done 120
> time query gametime
> cdevtest tickwarp status
expect verb=tickwarp started=2400
expect verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=2400 asked=2400 .*tps=([4-9]\d|\d{3,})
expect verb=tickwarp running=false
look game time after the warp is at least {G0+2400}

## SQ-TX-07r | tickwarp 6000 with a bot near the second wheat field (field replanted at age 0)
> fill 920 -60 902 935 -60 917 minecraft:wheat
> pbot spawn T 927 -60 920 minecraft:overworld creative
> cdevtest ages 920 -60 902 935 -60 917 minecraft:wheat
> cdevtest tickwarp 6000
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done 400
> cdevtest ages 920 -60 902 935 -60 917 minecraft:wheat
expect verb=ages .*n=256 mean=0.000
expect verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=6000 asked=6000 .*tps=([2-9]\d|\d{3,})
expect verb=ages .*n=256 mean=(0\.[1-9]|0\.0[1-9]|[1-9])

## SQ-TX-08r | watch the chest inventory, bread added during the watch
> item replace block 900 -60 900 container.1 with minecraft:air
pace 0
> cdevtest watch 900 -60 900 40 10 what=inv
sleep 0.6
> item replace block 900 -60 900 container.1 with minecraft:bread 2
pace 2
waitlog verb=watch end=done t=40 30
expect verb=watch t=0 .*items=0:minecraft:apple\*5
expect verb=watch t=40 .*1:minecraft:bread\*2
count verb=watch t=(0|10|20|30|40) == 5

## SQ-TX-12r | Loading Protection and attack (weak with pace 0)
> pbot spawn A 960 -60 900 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 1
> pbot inv A set 0 minecraft:iron_sword
pace 0
> pbot attack A @e[type=minecraft:iron_golem,limit=1,sort=nearest]
> pbot attack A @e[type=minecraft:iron_golem,limit=1,sort=nearest] weak
pace 2
> pbot remove A
> pbot spawn A 960 -60 900 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 1
> pbot attack A @e[type=minecraft:iron_golem,limit=1,sort=nearest]
expect Player A logged in, protection active for 150 seconds
count verb=pbot.attack bot=A target=minecraft:iron_golem strength=1 == 2
expect verb=pbot.attack bot=A target=minecraft:iron_golem strength=0\.[0-2]\d*\b
look each attack line health_after below health_before

## SQ-TX-14r | eat bread (difficulty easy for the row), shoot a bow
> difficulty easy
> pbot hunger A 10
> pbot inv A set 0 minecraft:bread 2
> pbot inv A select 0
> pbot eat A
sleep 3
> cdevtest food minecraft:bread
> pbot inv A set 0 minecraft:bow
> pbot inv A set 9 minecraft:arrow 16
> pbot look A 0 0
> pbot useitem A main 20
sleep 2
> cdevtest entities 960 -60 900 40 type=minecraft:arrow
> difficulty peaceful
expect verb=pbot.eat bot=A .*result=CONSUME using=true use_ticks=32 .*food=10
expect verb=pbot.useitem bot=A end=finish item=minecraft:bread
expect verb=pbot.useitem bot=A .*using=true use_ticks=\d+ release_after=20
expect verb=pbot.useitem bot=A end=released
expect verb=entities n=[12]\b
look finish line food = 10 + bread nutrition (5) and sat = cdevtest food saturation; finish tick 32 after the eat line's tick
